# CLAUDE.local.md

Local machine setup — not checked in (see .gitignore). Loaded alongside CLAUDE.md.
Do not scan filesystem other than the project folder without checking with me.

# Frappe and ERPNext local setup

Frappe bench is available at:  /path/to/venv/bin/bench
Full path to the bench directory where bench commands should be run from: /path/to/benches/<bench-name>
e.g
/path/to/venv/bin/bench --site <site-name>.test list-apps
frappe  15.x.x version-15
erpnext 15.x.x version-15

A site with ERPNext is available at: http://127.0.0.1:<port>
ERPNext site name: <site-name>.test
ERPNext site admin username/password: Administrator/<password>
If the site is not running ask me to start it.


use frappe-dev skills when required.
